{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:41 2026-11-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:41 2026-11-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:41 2026-11-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"48歲男獨行大帽山 心口痛急報案 直升機趕至送院惜太遲\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35f80750205cf49d4ad2804be8302b91/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20240101_140740784_02.jpg\"/><p>大帽山一名48歲姓楊男子，今日（11月9日）自行報案，表示獨自行山期間感到心口痛。搜救人員接報趕至時，報案人已經昏迷，隨即被直升機送往東區搶救，可惜最終不治。男子死因仍在調查。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:35.948720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:41:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:21.082100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:27.406801+00:00","content_hash":"ffd87b6bd2ef314e2b6ed3aecc4f7887e92aae2c079ec88e9b1a5755e6516dda","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}